name: repudiation
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: true
note: a belief or feature was declared a MISTAKE and killed outright — not flipped to a new value (that is contradiction), but repudiated as wrong-from-the-start. "We believed X; X was bad design." Membrane verb: correct, or a delete when the surface it produced is torn out.
route: surface, wake
